<span id="S5.T2.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p">Plan A - ODM Prompt Augmentation</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S5.T2.2.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S5.T2.2.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:19.9pt;">
<span id="S5.T2.2.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">81.3</span>
</span></td>
<td id="S5.T2.2.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top">
<span id="S5.T2.2.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:19.9pt;">
